        // If the call did NOT revert (i.e., the player won),
        // then immediately after the pot MUST be 0 (reset after payout).
        // The buggy version resets pot = 0 before the win check,
        // making the transfer of (pot - FEE_AMOUNT) underflow and always revert,
        // so a non-reverting call is impossible, breaking this rule.
